o the chaos of the times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285500/extras/472cb14a181f591b3279e4f756125a75.avif?t=1766667910\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285500/extras/cd22cd557226b27e2169fec46b3b04f4.avif?t=1766667910\" width=471 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    With over 450,000 words of text, the game provides a flexible development path. Eliminate bandits, collect bounties, ambush merchant caravans, resist foreign invaders, and restore order to the court\u2014the game features all conceivable missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285500/extras/d6f901fe5c055f9330767e6080ec371f.avif?t=1766667910\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285500/extras_big/d6f901fe5c055f9330767e6080ec371f.avif?t=1766667910 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285500/extras/f512f40b6b7d19126ea025278bbd5553.avif?t=1766667910\" width=471 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Strive to recreate the vibe of ancient cold weapon warfare, starting with the enjoyment of small-scale battles for early growth. Later, experience the epic sensation of larger-scale army combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285500/extras/0af9c620ab0cea9087c6c7e1aa17f15f.avif?t=1766667910\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285500/extras_big/0af9c620ab0cea9087c6c7e1aa17f15f.avif?t=1766667910 width=1170 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285500/extras/647f4936f2855724eb0285c2942f3006.avif?t=1766667910\" width=471 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    The game begins with a relatively high difficulty level, so players unfamiliar with survival or strategy games should proceed with caution. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Players who are not familiar with the warlords of the Three Kingdoms may find it hard to immerse themselves, but they can gradually uncover the secrets of this world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    The game does not feature flashy combat visuals, so those who prefer spectacular action scenes should be wary.</p>","developers":["NanBei Studio"],"dlc":[3786750,4243340,4243370],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285500/52f812ad23e8c33ac7fe4423309602ac3c993c44/header.jpg?t=1766667910","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3285500/1150097213/04503b37e68436a0f749d544d2363f0599537031/1750825303/dash_av1.mpd?t=1750063644","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3285500/1150097213/04503b37e68436a0f749d544d2363